{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Emmer Edette, a cheerful and carefree child who discovers she inherited her famous father's ability to 'save' moments in time at specific points worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside her grumpy dragon toy sidekick, Tippleton, she embarks on a journey to overwrite all of the world\u2019s save points (\u201cSave Stops\u201d) and confront her father, a once-great Hero using his power for nefarious means. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore six vibrant lands, recruit the Hero\u2019s former foes, and save the world from an untimely end! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a classic quest: </strong>Travel to the six lands the Hero once visited, overwriting his Save Stops along the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join forces with boss allies: </strong>Eager to confront the Hero, five ex-bosses will join you on your adventure\u2014these former formidable foes have uniquely powerful abilities and action costs inspired by traditional RPG boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover a bright pixel art world: </strong>From the autumnal Badwoods to the swampy kingdom of Mirell, each land brings unique combat challenges to face and overworld puzzles to solve</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover secrets: </strong>Compete in optional minigames to unlock special equipment and hidden lore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy 30+ original tracks: </strong>A warm and catchy original soundtrack composed by Dale North accompanies your journey </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1553590?t=1758768718","background_raw":"https://stor